  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      507.68,
      289.09,
      575.35
    ],
    "text": "THE notice is hereby given under the Sub section (01) in the Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act (Amended) No. 28 of 1964 as the Government intends to acquire the below mentioned land/Servitude for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      576.79,
      286.7,
      678.8
    ],
    "text": "The description of the land to be Acquired : The lots No. 01 & 02 called as Kuruntuwatta in two lands of the Preliminary Plan bearing No.: \u0d9c\u0dcf 4322 of the Surveyor General, located at the Induruwa village, within the Grama Niladhari Division 8 C - Athuruwella, of the Bentota Divisional Secretariat Division, in Galle District, Southern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
