  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      461.84,
      539.62,
      529.28
    ],
    "text": "The all claimants and people who have ownership or other relation to the aforementioned land themselves or the people who are authorized by their documents should be appeared before me at 10.00 a.m. on 25th, September, 2019, at the Divisional Secretariat, Bentota.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      530.72,
      539.62,
      609.92
    ],
    "text": "Further, the nature of their ownership related to the mentioned land, details on the facts for claiming compensation regarding the acquiring that land, the amount of compensation and the way it is calculated shall be received to me by duly completed copies prior to the 18.09.2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
