      65.04,
      284.47,
      275.88,
      294.55
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or Servitude to be Acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      57.84,
      309.92,
      294.87,
      366.08
    ],
    "text": "The lot No. 01 in Surveyor General\u2019s Plan No. \u0d9a 4757 is situated at village of Aluthgama in Grama Niladhari\u2019s Division of 765-Aluthgama East in Divisional Secretariat Division of Beruwala in Kaluthara District, Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      57.84,
      367.25,
      294.81,
      435.44
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01 Name of the land: Dehigahawatta; Description: Acquisition for K/Sanghamiththa Balika Vidyalaya; Claimant: Sembakutti Kankanamge Samson Fernando; Extent: 0.0885 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      57.84,
      436.88,
      294.76,
      481.52
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land Marks : North : Road and Dehigahawatta claimed by B. Indunil Fernando and Road; East : Dehigahawatta claimed",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      310.08,
      118.16,
      545.63,
      174.31
    ],
    "text": "by B. Indunil Fernando, Road and Walipanna Road; South : Walipanna Road and Sellagewatta claimed by Sangamiththa Balika Vidyalaya; West : Sellagewaththa Possess by Sangamiththa Balika Vidyalaya and Lindamulagewatta (Lot No. 1 of Plan No. P.P.K. 2386).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      310.08,
      198.57,
      548.01,
      328.4
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat of Beruwala on the 26th day of August 2019 at 10.00 a.m., and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 19th day of August 2019, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
